The HAETAE implementation in this directory is derived from the official
HAETAE 1.2.0 reference implementation published by Team HAETAE:

- Project: <https://www.kpqc.cryptolab.co.kr/haetae>
- Release archive SHA-256:
  `e54f8f962eefadbb2929bca292797bc7ca18769fb9a273c10204f3887fd83e84`
- License: MIT; see `LICENSE` in this directory.

The byte-aligned rANS implementation in `haetae_rans_byte.h` retains its
